<flow-demo>
  <div class="flow-demo-grid" aria-label="正常文档流与绝对定位对比">
    <figure>
      <figcaption><strong>正常流</strong><span>每个盒子依次占位</span></figcaption>
      <div class="flow-card normal-flow-card">
        <div>标题</div>
        <div>正文自然撑开高度</div>
        <div>操作区</div>
      </div>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <figcaption><strong>局部定位</strong><span>只有角标脱离正常流</span></figcaption>
      <div class="flow-card positioned-card">
        <b>NEW</b>
        <div>标题</div>
        <div>正文仍然依次占位</div>
        <div>操作区</div>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <p>定位改变的是局部叠加关系，不应替代正文的自然流动。</p>
</flow-demo>

<style>
  flow-demo { display: block; margin: 12px 0 32px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-muted); }
  .flow-demo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  figure { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
  figcaption { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 13px; }
  figcaption span { color: var(--text-subtle); font-size: 12px; }
  .flow-card { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 8px; min-height: 180px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--diagram-border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .flow-card div { display: flex; align-items: center; min-width: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--diagram-fill); border-radius: 4px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .flow-card div:nth-of-type(2) { color: var(--diagram-text); }
  .positioned-card b { position: absolute; inset-block-start: 10px; inset-inline-end: 10px; z-index: 1; padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--action); color: var(--on-action); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .positioned-card div:first-of-type { padding-inline-end: 52px; }
  flow-demo > p { max-width: 720px; margin: 14px auto 0; color: var(--text-subtle); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { flow-demo { padding: 14px; }.flow-demo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.flow-card { min-height: 0; } }
</style>
